igger one and earn more money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge small fruits into larger ones to increase your profits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436990/extras/Merge2.gif?t=1742792065\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udd64 <strong>Make Juice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Put fruits into a cup to make delicious juice!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can display the juice on the counter and sell it to customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The better the fruit you use, the more expensive the juice will be\u2014so aim to make the best juice possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436990/extras/Juice2.gif?t=1742792065\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience various stories alongside the character, who dreams of making the world's best juice! Watch as they grow and improve through their efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436990/extras/Story_EN.gif?t=1742792065\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a1 <strong>Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To expand your caf\u00e9, upgrades are essential!</strong> <br>Increase fruit income, juice prices, and more to boost your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep upgrading, and the day you create the world's best juice won\u2019t be far away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436990/extras/Upgrade.jpg?t=1742792065\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2b50 Prestige</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to gain special abilities, try <strong>Prestige!</strong> <br>Prestige unlocks powerful new features with stronger effects.</p